---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Motiva Hub" description="How Motiva Hub collects, uses and protects your data: analytics, cookies, advertising and your rights. Read our full privacy policy.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 20, 2026</p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics data:</strong> anonymous information such as pages visited, approximate location, and device type, used to understand which articles are helpful.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact information:</strong> if you contact us, we receive your name, email address, and message so we can respond.</li>
        <li><strong>Account information:</strong> if authentication is enabled, your email and hashed password.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> used for basic site functionality and, if advertising is displayed, by third-party advertising networks such as Google AdSense.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>We may display advertisements served by Google AdSense. Google uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To improve our content and site experience</li>
        <li>To respond to your messages</li>
        <li>To display relevant advertising</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting us. You can also disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>